        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>주의집중(attention)</choice_text>
          <commentary>주의집중은 특정 정보를 선택하는 과정이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>부호화(encoding)</choice_text>
          <commentary>부호화이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>시연(rehearsal)</choice_text>
          <commentary>시연은 정보를 반복하여 작동기억에 유지하는 과정이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
